WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.440
Reservations: every reservation with its status, payments and deposit.

2
00:00:06.986 --> 00:00:10.850
Find a reservation with search and the "Upcoming" filter.

3
00:00:11.395 --> 00:00:16.300
Open it to "Ask for the deposit" or "Ask for the balance".

4
00:00:16.849 --> 00:00:22.070
At return or check-out, deduct any damage and click "Release the rest".

5
00:00:22.617 --> 00:00:27.360
Always write a reason for a deposit deduction; it's sent to the customer.
